(7692972, 1260843, 3306, '<td valign="top">Roz, you never cease to amaze me. You have mastered the art of macro insect photography that not only exemplifies the beauty of the creature but also the environment in which they live. This takes a special talent and attention to detail. Congratulations not only on your one of many ribbons but your unique talent.</td>', 'Roz, you never cease to amaze me. You have mastered the art of macro insect photography that not only exemplifies the beauty of the creature but also the environment in which they live. This takes a special talent and attention to detail. Congratulations not only on your one of many ribbons but your unique talent.', '2021-04-30 08:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7692973, 1260843, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations <br/>Beautiful image! This is inline with your work, always very crisp subjects with corner to corner coverage of beautiful backgrounds. <br/>I love that the bug is on crisp metal (fence maybe?) Your subjects are so well focused they look 3D and jump off the page.<br/>A very well deserved blue.</td>', 'Congratulations Beautiful image! This is inline with your work, always very crisp subjects with corner to corner coverage of beautiful backgrounds. I love that the bug is on crisp metal (fence maybe?) Your subjects are so well focused they look 3D and jump off the page.A very well deserved blue.', '2021-04-30 08:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
