(7693122, 1260686, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like your picture because it is beautifully uncomplicated and yet there is a lot to see. It is fun to look at the different but consistent shapes of the bottles and then you make the hole image pop with the inconsistent colorful flower and then pull it all together by matching the one blue bottle with the flower. A truly artistic approach!</td>', 'I really like your picture because it is beautifully uncomplicated and yet there is a lot to see. It is fun to look at the different but consistent shapes of the bottles and then you make the hole image pop with the inconsistent colorful flower and then pull it all together by matching the one blue bottle with the flower. A truly artistic approach!', '2021-05-01 07:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7693123, 1260907, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like how you composed this. Its colorful and fun. You must have had a good time putting it together!</td>', 'I really like how you composed this. Its colorful and fun. You must have had a good time putting it together!', '2021-05-01 07:30:31.000000', NULL, 0),
